title: "robinhood-chain-trading-bot"
abstract: "Open-source autonomous trading bot for Robinhood Chain. Four strategies: launch sniping, momentum, Stock Token premium/discount arbitrage, and a bring-your-own-key LLM strategist (Claude, OpenAI, Groq, or OpenRouter). Real risk caps, real signed swaps, paper mode by default, live P&L dashboard."
